WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.230
Pusula was the first to wake that morning. And what she saw made her light tremble.

2
00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.630
AyShe, wake up. Another signal went out from the camp last night.

3
00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.690
And this time, I know who sent it.

4
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.820
Who? Tell me, Pusula.

5
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.020
Leon.

6
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.480
Next to Leon's bed lay a small device with a red light.

7
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:24.250
What is this? I... I've never seen it before. I swear.

8
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.000
I believe him. Leon would never betray us.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.020
You're right, Anka. This isn't betrayal.

10
00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.850
A code was planted inside Leon. Shadow's code.

11
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.570
Leon held his head in his hands.

12
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.150
A red light flashed in his eyes for a moment, then faded.

13
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.040
Then stay away from me. I'm putting you in danger.

14
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.480
No. Nobody leaves anybody. We'll bring you back.

15
00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:54.480
There's a way. My pendant can build a bridge between two minds.

16
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.340
But someone has to enter Leon's dream.

17
00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:58.680
I'll go.

18
00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:02.230
AyShe placed the pendant over Leon's heart.

19
00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:05.860
And the two of them fell into a white light together.

20
00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:09.880
Leon's dream was a laboratory full of lights.

21
00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.050
The year was twenty ninety-nine.

22
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.510
Little Leon was crying in front of a capsule.

23
00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:19.760
And in the darkness, a red-eyed shadow was creeping toward him.

24
00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:22.770
You're mine now, twenty-two.

25
00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.090
No! He belongs to no one!

26
00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.120
Leon, can you hear me? The real you is here!

27
00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:31.930
Little Leon took AyShe's hand.

28
00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:35.310
And every light in the laboratory turned blue.

29
00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.040
I remember you. You're the one who always finds me.

30
00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:41.370
Shadow shattered with a scream.

31
00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:45.110
AyShe and Leon opened their eyes at the camp at the same moment.

32
00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:49.830
Welcome back! We had buckets of water ready to wake you up.

33
00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.550
Leon's eyes were blue again.

34
00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.610
Mira covered the red device in ice and smashed it to pieces.

35
00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:59.460
No one will ever spy on us again.

36
00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.890
I remembered something else.

37
00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:05.820
The rest of the capsule code: five, six, eight.

38
00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:08.090
Everyone cheered.

39
00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:13.820
But just then, someone appeared at the camp entrance. Alone. No helmet.

40
00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:17.820
I'm unarmed. We need to talk. I'm number four.

